ZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F48 verification is complete on commit 30e3682346041c2f6407947f5f64ec654c61de9e. Independent provenance validation confirmed upstream revision e3c7b167b065660605645cef7f101cbb324772e4, the Dockerfile path, unchanged upstream instructions, the sole startup-timeout modification, and a byte-identical 1,291-byte BSD-2-Clause license with SHA-256 a432e25d7fa27b288cc7ab6ea8e3a9aa27c101579de7fad7a3b5f534ba9e772a. The default suite passed with 16,818 tests, 64 skips, and 298 deselections. The focused harness test passed 14 tests. Lint, type checking, whitespace validation, commit-ticket validation, and plan-review currency passed. The final rebase added one nonoverlapping main commit, and the focused test passed again.","timestamp":1787638685741369001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CI evidence for Gerrit change 2210 patchset 1.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"run_id\": \"32816400869\",\n  \"status\": \"passed\",\n  \"duration\": 1937,\n  \"fixes_applied\": [],\n  \"retry_count\": 0\n}\n```\n\nEvery executed job passed. Gerrit reports Verified +1, LLM-Review +1, no unresolved comments, and a submittable state.","timestamp":1787640697570027001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787590170562241001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"ad569aa6-d803-4e97-bd9e-dd39b2b8d151","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a4c9-468c-e5aa-446f"}],"description":"## Context\n\nF48 is approved. The vendored Jira Data Center Dockerfile names an upstream path but omits the source revision, license identifier, protected license text, and modification statement. The upstream root `LICENSE` at commit `e3c7b167b065660605645cef7f101cbb324772e4` has SHA-256 digest `a432e25d7fa27b288cc7ab6ea8e3a9aa27c101579de7fad7a3b5f534ba9e772a`.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Update the comment header in `tests/external/live_jira_dc/Dockerfile` with the `pycontribs/jira` repository, commit `e3c7b167b065660605645cef7f101cbb324772e4`, source path `docker/jira-test-image/Dockerfile`, and license identifier `BSD-2-Clause`.\n- State that the local copy adds `-Dproduct.start.timeout=2700000` and expanded operational annotations while retaining the pinned base digest, Jira version, exposed port, and `-DskipAllPrompts=true`.\n- Store the pinned upstream root `LICENSE` bytes unchanged in `tests/external/live_jira_dc/pycontribs-jira-LICENSE.txt`.\n- Add an upstream source licensing subsection to `tests/external/live_jira_dc/README.md`. Point it to the stored license text and distinguish that source license from Atlassian product licensing.\n- Preserve the existing Atlassian product licensing paragraph.\n- Add a unit assertion in `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_jira_dc_harness_shape.py` that hashes the stored license bytes and compares them with the literal expected digest `a432e25d7fa27b288cc7ab6ea8e3a9aa27c101579de7fad7a3b5f534ba9e772a`. The assertion uses no network service or Jira harness.\n- Preserve every Dockerfile instruction.\n- Add no mechanical prose or character scanner.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] Provenance names the exact repository, revision, source path, and `BSD-2-Clause` identifier.\n- [x] `tests/external/live_jira_dc/pycontribs-jira-LICENSE.txt` has SHA-256 digest `a432e25d7fa27b288cc7ab6ea8e3a9aa27c101579de7fad7a3b5f534ba9e772a`.\n- [x] The modification statement identifies the added timeout flag and expanded annotations.\n- [x] Dockerfile instructions, base digest, Jira version, and entrypoint remain unchanged.\n- [x] The existing Atlassian product licensing paragraph remains unchanged.\n- [x] The default unit tier checks the pinned license digest without network or Docker access.\n- [x] No connected Jira Data Center harness runs during verification.\n- [x] Focused Dockerfile, license, lint, type, and whitespace checks pass.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `shasum -a 256 tests/external/live_jira_dc/pycontribs-jira-LICENSE.txt` and compare the result with `a432e25d7fa27b288cc7ab6ea8e3a9aa27c101579de7fad7a3b5f534ba9e772a`.\n- Run `pytest tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_jira_dc_harness_shape.py`.\n- Compare the Dockerfile noncomment instructions before and after the change.\n- Run the repository lint, type, and whitespace checks without starting the connected Jira Data Center harness.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_dc/Dockerfile","reason":"Add pinned source, license, and modification provenance without changing instructions."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_dc/README.md","reason":"Document upstream source licensing separately from Atlassian product licensing."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_dc/pycontribs-jira-LICENSE.txt","reason":"Preserve the upstream BSD-2-Clause license text."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_jira_dc_harness_shape.py","reason":"Protect the stored upstream license bytes with the pinned SHA-256 digest."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5"],["relates_to","a4c9-468c-e5aa-446f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5","parent_status_uuid":"2bc985ad-1162-4182-862e-b4f57c227c13","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["documentation","provenance","F48"],"ticket_id":"c119-2f8c-dfb2-4f52","ticket_type":"story","title":"Record pinned Jira Data Center Dockerfile provenance","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cae3a87d-6e27-4407-81da-4ad086bc0540","65250d83-458a-4a4c-b94d-37f0ad8bc0d6